[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 27121.788, "timestamp": "07:32:01", "text": "9号"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27124.548, "timestamp": "07:32:04", "text": "八月。而且这条直播流实际上是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27127.99, "timestamp": "07:32:07", "text": "在播放列表中。你可以找到霍洛卡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27130.51, "timestamp": "07:32:10", "text": "呃，从现在开始的直播和所有相关内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27133.788, "timestamp": "07:32:13", "text": "继续。是的，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27137.91, "timestamp": "07:32:17", "text": "我也喜欢版本控制。所以，是的，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27140.35, "timestamp": "07:32:20", "text": "从现在起就能找到它了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27142.99, "timestamp": "07:32:22", "text": "在。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27150.15, "timestamp": "07:32:30", "text": "所以，也涌现出了很多新东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27153.91, "timestamp": "07:32:33", "text": "最近刚出的，对吧？我们得到了这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27163.43, "timestamp": "07:32:43", "text": "去。最后。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27165.59, "timestamp": "07:32:45", "text": "我真的非常高兴"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27168.708, "timestamp": "07:32:48", "text": "威胁最终还是出现了。不是威胁"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27170.22, "timestamp": "07:32:50", "text": "论坛出现了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27171.388, "timestamp": "07:32:51", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27175.19, "timestamp": "07:32:55", "text": "最后，我花了差不多一整年的时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27178.388, "timestamp": "07:32:58", "text": "白天差不多，不算太多，但要设置"}]